SECURITY AND NETWORK NOTICE

TRU SDK is infrastructure software. Applications built with it may
interact with cryptographic keys, blockchain transactions, digital
assets, smart contracts, mining systems, distributed compute systems,
and network services.

Developers are responsible for:
